        <mxCell id="c46" value="&lt;i&gt;Major bars share the dollar scale. The $0.69 rounding marker is enlarged for visibility; read its label for the amount. List less reductions less promotions is $29,756,419.39, and the rounding is what separates it from the net billed.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="486" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
